  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnering for inclusive impact: strengthening global networks to boost transparency and capital mobilisation in EMDEs (GSG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">i) Impact Transparency 
? Raise awareness, develop knowledge and support capacity building efforts around some of the main ongoing global initiatives to increase impact transparency, including the work being led by the ISSB to develop a global, harmonised sustainability disclosure baseline, amongst key stakeholders in EMDEs (corporates, investors, regulators and other public sector, SMEs, etc.).
? Ensure that the voices of the above mentioned stakeholders, including representatives of smaller companies, are included in the standards design and setting process. 

ii) Capital Mobilisation
? Strengthen the role of DFIs and PDBs in supporting growth-stage market development.
? Support the development and blueprinting of financial solutions, including local capacity-building, to mobilise capital from domestic and international capital providers to meet the financing gaps faced by SDG-focused SMEs and strengthen capital markets in EMDEs.</narrative>
  </description>
